# process|service|description
systemd-resolved|DNS Resolver|Provides local DNS resolution.
sshd|OpenSSH Server|Allows remote login via SSH.
syncthing|Syncthing|Synchronizes files between devices.
steam|Steam|Steam Remote Play and LAN services.
cupsd|CUPS|Printing service.
docker-proxy|Docker|Publishes container ports.
brave|Brave Browser|Local mDNS/DNS-SD discovery (port 5353).
code|VS Code|Local server for extensions and dev tools.
Discord|Discord|Voice/video calls and RPC for game integration.
dnsmasq|dnsmasq|Local DNS/DHCP forwarder.
steamwebhelper|Steam Web Helper|Steam's embedded browser/UI process.
youtube-music|YouTube Music Desktop|Local mDNS/DNS-SD discovery (port 5353).